3e 00                   ; x86-64
01 00 00 00             ; toleo 1
78 00 40 00 00 00 00 00 ; kiingilio 0x400078
40 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ; umbali wa maelezo ya vipande 64
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ; umbali wa maelezo ya sehemu 0
00 00 00 00             ; machaguo ya ELF
40 00                   ; ukubwa wa utangulizi 64
38 00                   ; ukubwa wa maelezo ya kipande 56
01 00                   ; idadi ya vipande 1
00 00 00 00 00 00       ; e_sh* 0
01 00 00 00             ; PT_LOAD
07 00 00 00             ; soma+andika+tekeleza
00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ; umbali kwenye faili 0
00 00 40 00 00 00 00 00 ; anwani pepe 0x400000
00 00 40 00 00 00 00 00 ; anwani halisi
fb 03 00 00 00 00 00 00 ; ukubwa kwenye faili 1019
00 00 40 00 00 00 00 00 ; ukubwa kwenye kumbukumbu MB 4: kuingiza 0x500000, kutoa 0x600000, makro 0x700000
00 10 00 00 00 00 00 00 ; mpangilio wa kipande

